## SECURITY BEST PRACTICES

```
1. .env NEVER in git
   └── Add .env to .gitignore immediately
   └── Use render.yaml env vars for production
   └── Rotate any keys already exposed

2. CORS — whitelist only
   └── Never use '*' in production
   └── CORS_ORIGINS = exact GitHub Pages URL only

3. Rate Limiting
   └── /api/chat      → 30 req/min per IP
   └── /api/generate  → 20 req/min per IP
   └── /api/agent     → 10 req/min per IP

4. Input Validation
   └── Validate and sanitize ALL user input with Zod
   └── Max message length: 4000 chars
   └── Strip HTML from all inputs

5. Helmet.js
   └── Add to every Express app — sets security headers

6. Error messages
   └── Never expose stack traces in production
   └── Generic errors to client, full logs server-side only

7. API Keys
   └── Never in frontend code
   └── Never in git history
   └── Rotate quarterly
```

